{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "7efc926b2572bc61ef4125d53d9c294b632d4bcbb6831b994099a327abeb7e2f", "ja": "まだまだ成長期！", "zh": "还在成长期！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c81e36516099e42a314ebf943c85bfef5c29e831dadaf570b8ae1a6992af922f", "ja": "ツアーの会場を下見した帰り、美味しそうな\n匂いに誘われ、みんなで餃子屋へ！　一軒で\nは物足りなさそうなアイドル達に、プロデュ\nーサーは餃子屋のハシゴを提案する。懐事情\nは……気にしない！", "zh": "下班回程途中，大家被诱人的香味吸引，一起去了饺子店！对于看起来只吃一家店还不满足的偶像们，制作人提议再连吃几家饺子店。至于钱包嘛……不用在意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ca7bcc6d957c4a5c39c9dfd0071283f277dd989858e9731a5534d33d2eb219b5", "ja": "（会場の下見に行った帰り道のこと。\n美味しそうな匂いに誘われて、商店街へと足を向けた）", "zh": "（在考察会场回去的路上。\n被诱人的香味吸引着，我们朝商店街走去）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "0ac74fb9bd5be0430f4fdfa45d28338544226e2d13ad240052bd60b9d112fc51", "ja": "はぁ……幸せでしゅ♪\n餃子、とっても美味しかったですね！", "zh": "哈啊……好幸福呀♪\n饺子特别好吃呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "a80a7d2d79d85b09d073b9a50065ea6d7693bc59d8f94d6e32f9d93e93d824e8", "ja": "ねー、メッチャおいしかった～♪\nそうそう、劇場のみんなにもお土産に買ってく？", "zh": "对——真的超好吃的～♪\n对了，要不要也买点伴手礼带给剧场的大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "99d4c689396df50bf5a6620540e427c4a74ce75335835e651b6bb6a7d76d0d31", "ja": "あ、いいですね！\nきっと美奈子さん、張り切って焼いてくれますよ。", "zh": "啊，好主意！\n美奈子小姐肯定会兴致勃勃地烤给我们吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "ba8817c2390ab0c88e1d505399921835cd0e44e1cb1d7e2610abf25be820d730", "ja": "どこで買おっか？　美味しそうな\n餃子屋さんばっかりで、迷っちゃうな～。", "zh": "在哪儿买好呢？到处都是看起来很好吃的饺子店，真让人纠结啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "19e0b17ce3555443eb4663f99f8c12bfa2e1e9ddd5bfef21bbf82ec63e265ce7", "ja": "むー……茜ちん！　真美は忘れてないかんね！\nギョーザいっこ食べられた恨みを……。", "zh": "唔……茜亲！真美可没忘记呢！那份被你吃掉一个饺子的怨念……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8331befaadd52f11443b5222e70976c530f10fa9701e1341f4b39ad41483fc78", "ja": "でも真美、俺の皿からふたつ食べてたよな？", "zh": "不过真美，你不是还从我的盘子里吃了两个吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "7c3517a7c524b27a272689511f86a3f95fa1294a38a901e570d8b47ddf42017c", "ja": "にゃはは♪　でも気持ちわかるよ～。\nギョーザっていくらでも入っちゃうよね！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪不过我能理解你的心情哦～  \n饺子这种东西，多少都吃得下呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "55b8aa9332c956f56d86177a2a0a1d95cce537bfe3b803068d010b3a8a7452f1", "ja": "そうですよね。種類も色々あるから飽きないし。\n気を付けないと、食べ過ぎちゃうかも……。", "zh": "是啊。种类也很多，所以怎么吃都不会腻。\n不注意的话，说不定会吃太多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "bf05c9a453e0ea749f67c17ea0c702eab98e4143e5452187843c1eaafd6082f5", "ja": "フッ……言っとくけど、真美はまだまだ本気じゃ\nないから！　成長期を甘く見ちゃダメっぽいよ～。", "zh": "哼……先说好，真美还远远没认真起来呢！\n可别小看成长期哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7a543dac11be7a87d7189ec3e6de2095e1ffb13e6aef5c7610d9204eb6053fde", "ja": "うん？　もしかしてみんな、まだお腹空いてるのか？\nならせっかくだし、もう一軒行こうか。", "zh": "嗯？难道大家还没吃饱吗？\n那正好，再去下一家店吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "bc6ddff3ba060d44f9b55d3d4f752dc36801b7a27351d492b9a5c259a832db58", "ja": "やったー♪", "zh": "太好了──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "36ae40f6f63e91a92968c98a815241e460bcbb2177c4eea0e7533c3571dde981", "ja": "やった！", "zh": "太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e248c787c7b3f9e3746d4816b963d1d77da1f9c8642e44c23a0ff5d6bacc871c", "ja": "ん？　エミリー、どうした？\nひょっとして、もうお腹いっぱいなのか？", "zh": "嗯？艾米莉，怎么了？\n难道说，你已经吃饱了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "1b75a06b03a0841980057f15e270d1067756fe0f8182c6adbb1b5e44813cd813", "ja": "あ……い、いえ！　私も、もう少しだけ\n食べたいと思っていたのですが……その……。", "zh": "啊……不、不是！我也正想再吃一点的……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1018_032emi", "source_sha256": "e7f7f0398fc4e77b53c9986f4a9c867cfa56e4c3b17c4380f800e4c374095105", "ja": "あまりたくさん食べるのは、\n大和撫子として、はしたないような気が……うぅ。", "zh": "吃太多的话，\n总觉得有失大和抚子的体统……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e0634cbf02b4ee32522e78dfe5d580e6fea96836476ec58fabd8bad858a308d5", "ja": "なるほど……まあ、気にすることないと思うけど。\n心当たりがなくもないからな。", "zh": "原来如此……不过，我觉得没必要在意。\n我也不是完全没有头绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1020_p", "source_sha256": "79bbbeff841cb1c0b2cfb90a5049b9d45f6eec529e74e2a2b4f02f65b89be0bf", "ja": "立派なアイドルだけど、たくさん食べる人。", "zh": "是位出色的偶像，但也是个很能吃的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "e6a6659bc1e393f0c9d5c9ef93e445a09f26107e6cf484b22023555958876d6a", "ja": "ハッ！？　た、確かに……わかりました！\nたくさんいただいて、その分お稽古いたします♪", "zh": "哈！？确、确实如此……我明白了！\n我会多吃一些，再用相应的努力来练习♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f138976a9fcdc94f66fe3edfffa53b4505c074520618286302dd721a7c235109", "ja": "（美味しいものを食べて、モチベーションが\n上がってくれるなら、安いものだ！）", "zh": "（如果吃好吃的东西能让她干劲十足，那这点花费根本不算什么！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0269_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0269_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1d731ee0ae1d50be80c9bdd814686894830775ea2ca4ab8cff3f9e08dc3fa75e", "ja": "（好きなだけ食べて……いや、やっぱり少し\n手加減……いやいや！　好きなだけ食べてくれ！）", "zh": "（想吃多少就吃多少……不，还是稍微节制一点……不不！尽管吃个够吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
